 fill="none" stroke="#a4a48f" stroke-opacity=".27" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M0 435q92-30 187 3m298-6q111-34 215-3" fill="none" stroke="#dfb47d" stroke-opacity=".29" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M36 356q35-57 71-2l-15-56 38 62M634 359q-31-54-67 0l11-48-33 56" fill="#12232c"/><path d="M324 345q36-73 68 0l-18-51 42 57" fill="#172a31"/><path d="M346 332h24v34h-24z" fill="#df9b55"/><circle cx="357" cy="335" r="22" fill="url(#glow)"/><path d="M351 318h12v28h-12z" fill="#ffd98d"/><ellipse cx="356" cy="456" rx="115" ry="13" fill="#091521" opacity=".55"/></svg><div class="story-top"><span class="chapter-tag">A tale of small lights</span><span class="moon-tag">☾</span></div><div class="story-copy"><h2>When the sun forgot to rise</h2><p>Beyond the village, an ancient beacon is fading. The valley’s last warm light is yours to protect.</p><div class="story-meta"><span>✦ &nbsp;3 chapters</span><span>◷ &nbsp;One brave little tale</span></div></div></article></section><div class="start-row"><span class="start-hint">Pick a role—or leave it to fate.</span><button class="primary-btn" id="startBtn" ${state.role?'':'disabled'}>Begin your adventure &nbsp;→</button></div>`;}
